The printed name of r_76 is "-= Stuffed Spare Room =-".
The stuffed spare room part 0 is some text that varies. The stuffed spare room part 0 is "You are in a spare room. A stuffed one. I guess you better just go and list everything you see here.



There is an exit to the north. Don't worry, it is unblocked.".
The description of r_76 is "[stuffed spare room part 0]".

The r_25 is mapped north of r_76.
